    <BlocklyJsonGuide><![CDATA[Use official Blockly JSON serialization. Top block example: { "type": "event_gameStart", "id": "b1", "x": 20, "y": 20, "fields": {}, "inputs": {}, "next": { "block": { "type": "engine_move", "id": "b2", "fields": { "STEPS": 10 } } } }. Statement inputs use inputs: { "DO": { "block": {...} } }. Value inputs use inputs: { "VALUE": { "block": {...} } }. Sequential statement blocks use next.block.]]></BlocklyJsonGuide>
